{"seq":3,"slug":"consistent-tooling-across-packages","title":"跨包一致的工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/consistent-tooling-across-packages","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨包一致的工具链\">跨包一致的工具链</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Monorepo 有一个常被低估的红利：几十个包可以共用一套 lint、格式化、TypeScript、测试与脚本约定，而不是各自为政。这对人类是新成员上手快，对 agent 则更根本——<strong>一致的工具链把 K 个陌生的小项目折叠成一个熟悉的大项目</strong>。Agent 在任何包里面对同样的命令、同样的规则、同样的配置继承链，它在根目录形成的预期处处成立。本节讲清一致性为何是 agent 的杠杆、哪些层面最值得统一、以及如何在不扼杀必要灵活的前提下守住一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一致性为什么是-agent-的杠杆\">核心概念：一致性为什么是 agent 的杠杆</h2><p>Agent 的行动模式是「带着预期工作」：读了根目录的约定，就假设整个仓库遵循它。工具链分裂会系统性地击碎这种假设——A 包用 Biome、B 包用 ESLint + Prettier、C 包没有 lint，agent 把在 A 包学到的修复方式用到 B 包，产出直接被 B 的规则拒绝；每一次意外都是一轮被浪费的迭代，且会诱导它对整个仓库的约定失去信心。</p>\n<p>用成本的语言说：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>各搞一套</mtext></munder><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext> 统一 </mtext></mpadded></mover><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mtext>一份基线</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>少量差异</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\underbrace{\\sum_{i=1}^{K} c_i}_{\\text{各搞一套}} \\quad\\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{统一}\\ }\\quad \\underbrace{c^{*} + K\\cdot\\varepsilon}_{\\text{一份基线}+\\text{少量差异}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.4323em;vertical-align:-2.604em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.2243em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8283em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">各搞一套</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8283em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8283em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.9027em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8283em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8283em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8283em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9257em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.604em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">统一</span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2067em;vertical-align:-1.468em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5903em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">一份基线</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">少量差异</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.2687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7313em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.468em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>统一前，掌握成本是各包学习量之和，随规模线性恶化；统一后只剩一份基线加每包的少量差异 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，几乎不随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 变化。<strong>一致性是对抗规模的手段，不是洁癖。</strong></p>\n<p>这个思路在 agent 上下文层同样成立。AGENTS.md 开放规范的建议是：大型 monorepo 在每个子项目里再放一份 AGENTS.md，agent 自动读取目录树上最近的那个、最近者优先——通用约定放根部，包特例下沉（规范举例称其写作时 OpenAI 主仓库维护着约 88 份，<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a>）。本仓库同构：根 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 定义全局纪律，<code>.agents/rules/</code> 细则按任务类型按需加载；分层上下文的设计与保鲜见<a href=\"../working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/context-and-conventions-at-scale\">规模下的上下文与约定</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"该统一什么\">该统一什么</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>统一做法</th>\n<th>单一真相源</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lint + 格式化</td>\n<td>全仓库一套工具一套规则</td>\n<td>共享 config 包或根配置</td>\n<td>本仓库一条 <code>biome check .</code> 覆盖全部包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>基础 tsconfig + 各包 <code>extends</code></td>\n<td>如 <code>packages/tsconfig/base.json</code></td>\n<td>子配置只覆盖个别编译选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖版本</td>\n<td>pnpm catalog 协议集中登记</td>\n<td><code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 的 <code>catalog:</code> 字段</td>\n<td>各包写 <code>&quot;xxx&quot;: &quot;catalog:&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚本动词</td>\n<td><code>dev/build/test/lint/typecheck</code> 语义固定</td>\n<td>各 package.json + 根聚合脚本</td>\n<td>本仓库根上 <code>pnpm -r test</code> 递归全仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有权</td>\n<td>共享配置指定 owner</td>\n<td>CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>基线文件改动强制 owner review</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两点值得展开。<strong>catalog 解决的是最隐蔽的漂移</strong>：同一个依赖在十几个包里写着各自的 semver 区间，装出来的依赖树就可能不一致，bug 只在部分包复现且极难归因。pnpm 的 <code>catalog:</code> 协议让版本号只在 workspace 清单登记一次，各包引用名字而非数值，升级变成改一行（<a href=\"https://pnpm.io/catalogs\">pnpm.io/catalogs</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml —— 版本只在这里出现一次&#10;catalog:&#10;  typescript: ~5.9.3&#10;  vitest: ^4.1.2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml —— 版本只在这里出现一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">catalog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  typescript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">~5.9.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  vitest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^4.1.2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>此后任意包的 <code>package.json</code> 里只需写 <code>&quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;catalog:&quot;</code>，装包时由 pnpm 解析成登记值；workspace 成员圈定与统一 scope 的约定见<a href=\"../structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/workspaces-and-package-layout\">Workspace 与包布局</a>。<strong>TypeScript 的 extends 是官方组合机制</strong>：一个 tsconfig 可继承另一份配置并覆盖选定字段（<a href=\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/tsconfig/\">typescriptlang.org/tsconfig</a>），天然给出「基线 + 例外」的结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    base[&quot;共享基线&lt;br/&gt;tsconfig/base.json · lint-config · catalog&quot;]&#10;    base --&gt; a1[&quot;apps/doc-hub&quot;]&#10;    base --&gt; a2[&quot;apps/english&quot;]&#10;    base --&gt; p1[&quot;packages/markdown&quot;]&#10;    base --&gt; p2[&quot;packages/ui&quot;]&#10;    own[&quot;CODEOWNERS: 平台组&quot;] -. 强制 review .-&gt; base\">flowchart TD\n    base[\"共享基线&lt;br/&gt;tsconfig/base.json · lint-config · catalog\"]\n    base --&gt; a1[\"apps/doc-hub\"]\n    base --&gt; a2[\"apps/english\"]\n    base --&gt; p1[\"packages/markdown\"]\n    base --&gt; p2[\"packages/ui\"]\n    own[\"CODEOWNERS: 平台组\"] -. 强制 review .-&gt; base</pre><p>lint 一侧的选型同理：ESLint 现行的 flat config（<code>eslint.config.js</code>）本身就是数组组合式设计，适合抽出共享片段供各包拼接（<a href=\"https://eslint.org/docs/latest/use/configure/configuration-files/\">eslint.org</a>）；Biome 这类一体化工具则把 formatter 与 linter 收进单一二进制和单一配置，「一致」的实现成本更低（<a href=\"https://biomejs.dev/\">biomejs.dev</a>）——本仓库选的是后者。所有权一行同样有现成机制：GitHub 按 CODEOWNERS 文件里声明的路径模式，自动向对应 owner 发起审查请求，让基线文件的每次改动都有人把关而不靠运气（<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners\">GitHub Docs</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在一致与灵活间平衡\">在一致与灵活间平衡</h2><p>失败模式有两种，方向相反。<strong>复制粘贴型漂移</strong>：图省事直接拷贝配置文件，从此每份拷贝独立演化，三个月后没人说得清哪份是真基线。治理不能靠自觉，要靠机器——CI 加一条 drift 检查，发现未 <code>extends</code> 共享基线的 tsconfig、或硬编码了本应走 catalog 的版本号就直接失败。<strong>过度统一型僵化</strong>：把某个应用的特有需求（如 SSR 特有的编译选项）塞进全局基线，所有纯客户端包被迫吞下。合理的结构是基线只放真正普适的严格度与选项，例外留在包内并注明理由——例外不可耻，无记录的例外才可耻。</p>\n<p>判断一条差异该不该存在的实用标准：<strong>如果新包脚手架能原样复制这条差异而无需理解它，它可以留在包内；如果它需要解释才能安全传播，它属于基线。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>新包从模板生发</strong>：提供带基线配置的脚手架命令，让「符合规范」成为默认动作而非事后补课（新包的形态与抽取时机参考<a href=\"../structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/shared-code-and-internal-packages\">共享代码与内部包</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>全仓升级一次到位，同时配好保险</strong>：共享基线的红利是一个 PR 升级全仓，代价是爆炸半径同样大——这正是 CODEOWNERS 存在的理由，基线文件的修改必须过 owner。</li>\n<li><strong>根上下文只放事实</strong>：根 AGENTS.md 记「用什么工具、命令是什么、配置在哪」，包特有约定下沉到嵌套文件，避免根部膨胀成没人读完的大杂烩。</li>\n<li><strong>人定规范，机器守规范</strong>：drift 检测进 CI 比写进 wiki 有效得多，文档说明「为什么」，检查器负责「不跑偏」。</li>\n<li><strong>用接入时间衡量一致性</strong>：新包接入工具链的时间趋近于零才达标——若接一个包要改半天配置，说明基线抽取还没做彻底。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>跨包一致的实质是把 K 份独立配置折叠成一份基线加显式例外：共享 tsconfig 与 lint 配置管代码层，catalog 管依赖版本，统一脚本动词管命令面，CODEOWNERS 管基线变更权。最大的受益者首先是 agent——它的预期在哪都成立；人排第二。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨包一致的工具链","id":"跨包一致的工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一致性为什么是 agent 的杠杆","id":"核心概念-一致性为什么是-agent-的杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"该统一什么","id":"该统一什么"},{"level":2,"text":"在一致与灵活间平衡","id":"在一致与灵活间平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"受影响范围分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/affected-and-impact-analysis"},"next":{"title":"把 Agent 的工作圈定到包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/scoping-agent-work-to-packages"}}